sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Admin
    participant FE as HROS Web
    participant API as RoleController
    participant Role as RoleModule
    participant Catalog as PermissionCatalog
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Admin->>FE: Open Role Matrix
    FE->>API: GET Role Matrix

    API->>Role: getRole(roleId)
    Role->>DB: Read Role + assigned Permission codes
    DB-->>Role: Role configuration

    Role->>Catalog: getPermissionCatalog()
    Catalog-->>Role: Platform Permission Catalog

    Role->>Role: Merge catalog with Role grants
    Role-->>API: Role Matrix DTO
    API-->>FE: Grouped Permissions + granted state
    FE-->>Admin: Display Matrix
